{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1613952000, "end_date": 1614556799, "month_true_total": 307, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:54:47 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "87636581", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961161953", "personaname": "Zolace", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961161953/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 9204, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6327, "last_played": 1630175987, "avatar": "3464fd2594fb6edae06d510084282084b23b6bea"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bottom line up front: This game is good, but it could have been better.\n\nAnyone who knows about the development of this game, and compares it to previous entries in the MA series will complain about how it doesn't measure up to its predecessors, or how it failed to live up to it's own potential.  While these things are true, Andromeda is a decent and detailed game in its own right.  I do have fun playing it despite the missed opportunities and shortcomings.  Story-wise I'm glad they restricted this to the Helius cluster and didn't cover the whole Andromeda galaxy given how the game turned out.  \n\nDespite the lack of diverse sentient species native to the Helius cluster, the wild animals that seem to show up on multiple planets without explanation (or at least good explanation), a nuanced set of first encounter story lines and so many other elements that this game could have had, I do find it fun.\n\nThe game mechanics are decently fun.  The story line is engaging enough to where you want to see it to the end.  The connection to the MA lore is detailed enough to make you feel that you're at least in the same universe.  If you approach this game fresh without having played the previous entries you'll definitely get a kick out of it, and it will make you appreciate the other MA games all the more.  In fact I might recommend playing this one first and then going back to play the rest of the MA series.  The experience might be better.", "timestamp_created": 1614552252, "timestamp_updated": 1614552252, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87636285", "author": {"steamid": "76561198280763911", "personaname": "HI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/InsideRussia/", "num_games_owned": 346, "num_reviews": 261, "playtime_forever": 13, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13, "last_played": 1613845849, "avatar": "fe639691663abb66576bc5ed99ecff8c8296e8fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "-", "timestamp_created": 1614551786, "timestamp_updated": 1614551786, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.219808012247085571", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87631574", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056743096", "personaname": "StarNuke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/StarNuke/", "num_games_owned": 141, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 2612, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2376, "last_played": 1623095407, "avatar": "ea0a219c6b050df80a47421b75339d2324e1e17f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bland characters and quests, but a great experience with the right mods", "timestamp_created": 1614545451, "timestamp_updated": 1614545451, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count"